{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"Process correction from the project owner: ADP is piloted for massgov and must never be run on its own code. ADP defects are fixed with a debugging skill and a manually opened PR against agentic-dev-platform under the ADEVX-<n> commit convention, with no rebar plan or code review gate. Verified the pipeline stayed clean, select distinct task_id from agent_platform.audit_events returns only the six pilot ids plus system, so no ADP ticket ever entered the pipeline. Genuine drift acknowledged, ADEVX-134 was wrapped in a rebar ticket and taken through both review gates."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789933512235508001,"uuid":"a69b39b3-fa23-4f8c-aa3e-d9fc4dede854"}